-field DPS / Battery"]}],"v":"Battery: Favonius + Exile for team energy.\nZibai: Instructor and DEF focus; Burst every other rotation.\nC4 Healing: Build extra DEF after meeting ER and CR needs.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support","Buffer"],"about":"Gorou buffs DEF and Geo DMG for Geo-focused teams, with stronger effects when the party has three Geo members. His Skill supplies the core buff; his Burst adds mobile buffs and extra DEF. Prioritize Energy Recharge and Favonius consistency over damage.","pros":["Strong DEF buffs","Low field time","Geo team synergy","Free best weapon"],"cons":["Geo-focused teams","High ER needs","Low personal damage","C6 boosts value"],"weapons":["Favonius Warbow","Elegy for the End","Sacrificial Bow","End of the Line","Snare Hook"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["The Exile"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge","DEF% / Geo DMG","Crit Rate / DEF%"],"stats":["ER: 200% - 220%","CR: 45% - 65%","DEF: Situational"],"vars":[{"title":"Geo Battery","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Warbow","Sacrificial Bow"],"arts":[{"sets":["The Exile"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize ER and Favonius CRIT Rate; use a 5-star off-set piece if needed.","teams":"Geo carry with demanding Burst energy needs.","when":"Choose this when team energy is more valuable than an additional damage buff.","cond":"Exile pieces are 4-star only.","notes":"Favonius requires a CRIT hit while Gorou is on field.","pre":false},{"title":"Lunar-Crystallize Support","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Warbow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"In short Zibai rotations, Burst every other rotation; invest more in DEF.","teams":"Zibai and consistent Lunar-Crystallize teammates.","when":"Instructor shares EM to strengthen Lunar-Crystallize damage.","cond":"A team-specific setup, not general Geo support.","notes":"Other teammates may already hold Silken Moon’s Serenade.","pre":false},{"title":"C4 Healing Utility","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Warbow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"After ER and Favonius CRIT needs, build DEF% for stronger C4 healing.","teams":"Gorou at C4+ in a DEF-based Geo team.","when":"Add light healing without changing Gorou’s core support role.","cond":"C4 required; healing is not a full sustain replacement.","notes":"C4 heals based on DEF while Burst is active.","pre":false}],"mats":["Prithiva Topaz Sliver","Prithiva Topaz Fragment","Prithiva Topaz Chunk","Prithiva Topaz Gemstone","Perpetual Heart","Teachings of Light","Guide to Light","Philosophies of Light","Spectral Husk","Spectral Heart","Spectral Nucleus","Sango Pearl","Molten Moment","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 6-8"}],"teams":[{"name":"Oni Command","members":["Gorou","Arataki Itto","Albedo","Durin"]},{"name":"Maid of Honor","members":["Gorou","Noelle","Furina","Yelan"]},{"name":"Moonstone Guard","members":["Gorou","Zibai","Illuga","Columbina"]},{"name":"Geo on a Budget","members":["Gorou","Noelle","Yun Jin","Fischl"]}]}}],"title":"Gorou","el":"Geo"}